{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107830","id":2609384876,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6biA2s","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107830","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107830.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107830.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107830","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107830/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107830/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107830/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/dcec3086d8b443627b23961b0213522a3d93755b","number":107830,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"SoftBody3D: Fix infinite delivery of transform notifications","user":{"login":"simpkins","id":163549,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MzU0OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/163549?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins","html_url":"https://github.com/simpkins","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"PR #105901 changed the behavior of how transform notifications are delivered to `VisualInstance3D` subclasses, which resulted in SoftBody3D receiving an infinite stream of transform notifications.\r\n\r\nSoftBody3D attempts to always keep its global transform at (0, 0, 0), and does so by listening for transform notifications and resetting it its transform back to 0 whenever it is changed externally.  It called `set_notify_transform(false)` before making its own change, so that it would not receive new notifications about its own change.  However, after PR #105901, transform notifications were still delivered anyway because `VisualInstance3D` had called\r\n`_set_notify_transform_when_fti_off(true)`.\r\n\r\nThis updates the `SoftBody3D` constructor to explicitly enable transform notifications, and to call `_set_notify_transform_when_fti_off(false)` so that it can still use `set_notify_transform(false)` to prevent receiving notifications about its own changes.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, I also changed the `NOTIFICATION_TRANSFORM_CHANGED` processing to ignore the notification if the global transform is already 0.  This should also be sufficient to stop the infinite notification change even if somehow it does receive a notification about its own change.\r\n\r\nThis fixes #107829.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"arc